Websites/Apps covered: https://randomtyms.github.io (RandomTyms) and RandomTyms Transfer tool

1. Overview
RandomTyms provides:
(a) RandomTyms website/app - memes, quotes, jokes, stories and random thoughts.
(b) RandomTyms Transfer - a personal tool to migrate GIFs owned by RandomTyms from Tenor to Pinterest.

2. Data Collection
For RandomTyms website/app (Store app):
We do NOT collect, store, or share any personal information. No login, no name, email, location or tracking. Favorites are saved only on your device (localStorage).

For RandomTyms Transfer tool:
We do not collect or store personal data on any server. The tool uses a Pinterest OAuth token you provide to authenticate with Pinterest API v5 to list your boards and create Pins on your own boards. The token is used only during the transfer session and runs locally on your device. No data is sent to our server or any third-party server besides Pinterest.

3. How We Use Information
- Website/app: No information used.
- Transfer tool: Access token is used solely to create Pins on your own Pinterest boards. No other use.

4. Data Storage
No user data is stored on any server. All operations for both apps run locally on the user's device / browser.

5. Third-Party Services
- GitHub Pages hosts https://randomtyms.github.io (see GitHub Privacy Policy).
- Pinterest API is used only for Transfer tool (see Pinterest Privacy Policy).
- Tenor.com is used only as source for GIFs owned by RandomTyms in Transfer tool (see Tenor Terms).

6. Cookies
RandomTyms website does not use cookies or tracking.

7. Children's Privacy
Both apps are suitable for all ages (3+). We do not knowingly collect data from children.

8. Changes
We may update this policy. The latest version will always be at https://randomtyms.github.io/RandomTyms-Privacy
